@*
    Root of the Workspace shell. Per H1.6's Contextual Command Surface:

        ConsoleShell
        +-- WorkspaceHost   (the editable pane tree)
        +-- ConsoleChrome   (persistent - toolbar/status)
        +-- EditorToolBar   (persistent - contextual soft keys, reacts to the shared EditorContext)
        +-- CommandLine     (persistent - what's being composed right now)
        +-- CommandSurface  (persistent - keypad/soft keys that compose it)

    EditorToolBar/CommandLine/CommandSurface are persistent console infrastructure, exactly like
    ConsoleChrome - never part of the pane tree, never closable/splittable Views. See each
    component's own doc comment for what it owns.
*@

<div class="console-shell">
    <ConsoleChrome />
    <div class="console-shell-workspace">
        <WorkspaceHost />
    </div>
    <EditorToolBar />
    <CommandLine />
    <CommandSurface />
</div>
